# Test new methods

When you add a new function or method to the codebase, add a corresponding test.

- Prefer the existing test layout: e.g. `scripts/build_artgan_index.py` → `tests/test_build_artgan_index.py`.
- Use `importlib` or direct imports as the project already does; keep tests self-contained with minimal fixtures (e.g. temp dirs, fake files).
- Cover at least one success path and, if relevant, edge cases (empty input, unknown/missing values).
